#! clause: E5.3
#! mode: run
#! requires: read_line
#! expect-raise: eof @ 8:1
#! input: read_line -> raise "eof"
# A capability resolution may RAISE at the call site instead of yielding a value (E§7.5): the host
# answers `read_line` with `raise "eof"`, so the call raises `eof`, uncaught, terminating the run.
read_line()
